<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>My GitHub App</title>
<style>
body{font-family:sans-serif;background:#f6f8fa;margin:0}
.header{ background:#fff; padding:12px; border-bottom:1px solid #d0d7de; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; }
.card{background:#fff; margin:10px; border:1px solid #d0d7de; border-radius:6px; padding:12px}
.btn-green{background:#1f883d; color:#fff; padding:6px 12px; border-radius:6px; border:none; font-weight:bold}
.search{width:100%; padding:8px; border:1px solid #d0d7de; border-radius:6px; margin-top:10px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="header">
  <b>Repositories</b>
  <span>github.com</span>
</div>
<div style="padding:12px; background:#fff">
  <h3 style="display:inline">My contributions</h3>
  <button class="btn-green" style="float:right">New repository</button>
  <input class="search" value="contributed-by:@me" readonly>
</div>
<div class="card">
  <b>superboyb654-max/M...</b> <span style="border:1px solid #ccc; border-radius:10px; padding:2px 6px; font-size:12px">Public</span>
  <div style="margin-top:8px; font-size:13px; color:#57606a">
    🔴 HTML · 0 forks · 0 stars · 9h ago
  </div>
</div>
<div style="padding:12px; text-align:center; color:#57606a; font-size:13px">
💡 ProTip! App ini udah jadi Bos kh, tinggal build jadi APK!
</div>
</body>
</html>
